# Tap tempo: hold HOME and tap SEQ in time. Two taps set it, the last four gaps average; a pause of
# two seconds starts over. SEQ's release does nothing (the steps screen doesn't open), nor HOME's.
# (The simulator reads the buttons once a block: a tap lands a few ms late, so the tempo is a bound.)
wait 300
expect tempo 125
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
tapkey w8
tap PLAY
press HOME
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 370
expect tempo 125
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 470
expect tempo >147
expect tempo <152
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 470
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 470
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
shot tap.png
release HOME
wait 100
expect view 1
expect playing 1
expect tempo >121
expect tempo <127
# a pause, then 4 taps at 100 BPM: the old taps are forgotten
wait 2500
press HOME
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 570
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 570
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
wait 570
press SEQ
wait 30
release SEQ
release HOME
expect tempo >98
expect tempo <102
expect dirty 1
# the help cards say how
wait 600
press HOME
wait 1000
shot homecard.png
release HOME
wait 100
expect view 1
press SEQ
wait 1000
shot seqcard.png
release SEQ
wait 100
